    ("GDBN", [], "mfg", "壞鄰居中的好晶粒", "被大量失效晶粒包圍的良品也剔除的篩選方式，車用零缺陷常用。", "Good die in bad neighbourhood", "Screening out good dies surrounded by failures; common for automotive zero-defect.", "production.html#pat"),
